// Light, written out in full.
//
// A complete user theme: every colour token the app reads, with the value this theme
// resolves to. Copy it, change the id and name, and edit what you like. Delete a line and
// that token falls back to the base palette instead. Lines marked "base" are the
// light palette's own value, which this theme inherits rather than sets.
//
// Colours are "#RRGGBB" (opaque) or "#AARRGGBB", where AA is the alpha. Several overlay
// and canvas tokens are translucent on purpose. A gradient is an object with start, end
// and stops. Token meanings are listed in docs/ui/theme-token-catalog.md.
//
// Install: put this file in the themes folder (Windows %APPDATA%\DemoViewer.NET\themes\,
// macOS ~/Library/Application Support/DemoViewer.NET/themes/, Linux ~/.config/DemoViewer.NET/themes/)
// and press Settings > Theme > Reload themes. An id that matches a built-in theme is ignored.
